    <values>
        <!-- Small-firm rule, business-stated 22 Jul: solo / single-user institutions / small law firms of
             4 or fewer attorneys use !SREN, and it must NOT be used where the Opportunity has a Group ID.
             Verified against 4,738 live !SREN/!SJSI lines: of !SREN lines with a known attorney count 74.5%
             are <=4, versus 9.6% for !SJSI. Write-on-blank-only and NOT in allKnownBases(), so it fills an
             empty promo but can never overwrite a rep. Blank either field to disable the rule. -->
        <field>Small_Firm_Attorney_Max__c</field>
